    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110355" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμᾰκ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>medicate,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμακώσαισ᾽ ἀντίτομα ὀδυνᾶν</span>
			<i>having endued</i> them <i>with healing power</i> against
			pains, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.221
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be poisoned,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελίκρατον πεφαρμακωμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.768d
				</span></i>
			; of an arrow, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				2.144
			</span></i> (v. l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be bewitched,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1477.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii/iv A. D.)</span>.</div>
